{"id":"596739a9c86dafde","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-rice-theorem.md","title":"Rice's Theorem","display":"df-rice-theorem — Rice's Theorem","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-rice-theorem","aliases":["88-df-rice-theorem"],"display":"df-rice-theorem — Rice's Theorem","depends_on":["[[88-df-rice-property]]","[[88-df-index-set]]","[[88-df-decidable-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-rice-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-rice-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-rice-theorem — Rice's Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8085e5127aec7739\" href=\"?note=8085e5127aec7739\" title=\"88-df-rice-property\">88-df-rice-property</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97c2d6a4b728542c\" href=\"?note=97c2d6a4b728542c\" title=\"88-df-index-set\">88-df-index-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a6c52aed1a56207b\" href=\"?note=a6c52aed1a56207b\" title=\"88-df-decidable-set\">88-df-decidable-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> (partial computable function property)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rice}(P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rice}(P)\\)</span> (nontrivial extensional-property predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8085e5127aec7739\" href=\"?note=8085e5127aec7739\" title=\"88-df-rice-property\">88-df-rice-property</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_P\">\\(I_P\\)</span> (index set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"97c2d6a4b728542c\" href=\"?note=97c2d6a4b728542c\" title=\"88-df-index-set\">88-df-index-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Decidable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Decidable}\\)</span> (decidable-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a6c52aed1a56207b\" href=\"?note=a6c52aed1a56207b\" title=\"88-df-decidable-set\">88-df-decidable-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RiceUndecidable}(P)\">\\(\\mathrm{RiceUndecidable}(P)\\)</span> (Rice-undecidability proposition)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rice\\text{-}theorem} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{RiceUndecidable}(P)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Rice}(P)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Decidable}(I_P)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rice\\text{-}theorem} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{RiceUndecidable}(P)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Rice}(P)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Decidable}(I_P)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本文件只定义命题 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RiceUndecidable}(P)\">\\(\\mathrm{RiceUndecidable}(P)\\)</span>；普遍成立性由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d537b31e66e4fbaf\" href=\"?note=d537b31e66e4fbaf\" title=\"88-thm-rice\">88-thm-rice</a> 断言。</li>\n<li>合取式排除了平凡性质因蕴含前件为假而被误称为“Rice 不可判定”的真空成立情形。</li>\n<li>待判定对象是索引集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_P\">\\(I_P\\)</span>，不是函数类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 本身。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-rice-property","status":"resolved","id":"8085e5127aec7739","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-rice-proper